oman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">2、乙方应根据合同约定及时、有效地为甲方提供技术服务。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">3、乙方应对甲方提供的技术资料和信息保密，未经甲方书面同意，不得向任何第三方泄露。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">4、乙方应保证其提供的技术服务不侵犯任何第三方的知识产权。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">六、 违约责任</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">1、</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">任何一方违反本合同约定，均应承担违约责任，并赔偿对方因此造成的损失。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">2、因不可抗力因素导致本合同无法履行或不能完全履行的，双方互不承担违约责任。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">七、 争议解决</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">1、本合同履行过程中发生的争议，双方应友好协商解决。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">2、协商不成的，任何一方均可向所在地人民法院提起诉讼。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">八、 其他</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">本合同一式 2 份，甲乙双方各执 1 份，经双方签字盖章后生效。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">本合同未尽事宜，双方可另行协商解决，并签订补充协议，补充协议与本合同具有同等法律效力。</span></p></div>\n<span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;