mily:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">2、乙方具备提供该系统技术服务的能力和经验。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">双方经友好协商，本着平等互利、诚实信用的原则，达成如下协议：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">一、 服务内容</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:\'yes\';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:\'Times New Roman\';font-size:14.0000pt;\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">乙方为甲方提供以下技术服务：</span><span style=\"m